{"id":"the-title","name":"The Title","type":"Submachine Gun","tier":"Legendary","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/31edf6772786e31836b1e63008a6b552.jpg","screenshot":"/common/destiny2_content/screenshots/55393445.jpg","columns":[{"label":"Barrel","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Arrowhead Brake","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8f7fb54687aa52a9c2595d90ce9c9417.png","desc":"Lightly vented barrel.\n  •  Greatly controls recoil\n  •  Increases handling speed"},{"name":"Chambered Compensator","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0b451cbccc7f11f6aec9c153e59474cb.png","desc":"Stable barrel attachment.\n  •  Increases stability\n  •  Moderately controls recoil\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Corkscrew Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7730e1732ed7ef91afce50277639c493.png","desc":"Balanced barrel. \n  •  Slightly increases range and stability\n  •  Slightly increases handling speed"},{"name":"Extended Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9e5e8fa07a84c29252b78b0e7b3106d.png","desc":"Weighty barrel extension.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Decreases handling speed\n  •  Moderately controls recoil"},{"name":"Fluted Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/260eba9dd149dbb94b1306c9ed4dd8db.png","desc":"Ultra-light barrel. \n  •  Greatly increases handling speed\n  •  Slightly increases stability"},{"name":"Full Bore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40a4bdcf0f5a4e492927f9569eaf529d.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for distance.\n  •  Greatly increases range\n  •  Decreases stability\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Hammer-Forged Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/2b9eb6d4489cffc18c10223279198bcc.png","desc":"Durable ranged barrel.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Polygonal Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d7aaccee29cf450d4057a9de871cdc8.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for recoil reduction.\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Smallbore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d1bb6a623f14959a47156ee71acfc3a.png","desc":"Dual strength barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Full Choke","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/629246e67fc8690d56b5478b0262131a.png","desc":"Tightened barrel. Reduces projectile spread when aiming down sights at the cost of precision damage."},{"name":"Rifled Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/79d5f1f469d3290cfb849f4b3e6fc16b.png","desc":"Ranged shotgun barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Greatly decreases handling speed"}]},{"label":"Magazine","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Extended Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/66cfea124e24e73cca1ce6370b44ca7e.png","desc":"This weapon has a greatly increased magazine size, but reloads much slower.\n  •  Greatly increases magazine size\n  •  Greatly decreases reload speed\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness"},{"name":"Alloy Magazine","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/069170916c98748b7b3e33b80bd7d689.png","desc":"Faster reload when the magazine is nearly empty."},{"name":"Appended Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9f468cce26fe35d9db413e2f8451127.png","desc":"This weapon's magazine is built for higher capacity.\n  •  Increases magazine size"},{"name":"Armor-Piercing Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b311ef00478243e21e2a5eec3a59f9d8.png","desc":"Rounds cause extra damage to combatants' shields and overpenetrate targets. \n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"High-Caliber Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d1c49edb2d2b24c74067742c09fd5a5.png","desc":"Shots from this weapon knock the target back farther.\n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Ricochet Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0a494d0442b32aff8c30d8b2b53561bd.png","desc":"Rounds ricochet off hard surfaces. \n  •  Increases stability \n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Flared Magwell","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f95e67e4ff37466505d66d3fa1030782.png","desc":"Optimized for fast reloading.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Greatly increases reload speed"},{"name":"Light Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/736b486ddb80beefacb4f09b5ad016eb.png","desc":"Improved reload and range.\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Accurized Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d85024478504205359c7fb52dbc4f6b6.png","desc":"This weapon can fire longer distances.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Tactical Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f0e309a267b25279a871d182f8910bcc.png","desc":"This weapon has multiple tactical improvements.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases magazine size"},{"name":"Drop Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d19f0c349652f0285bb5f999307b8a1.png","desc":"Increases reload speed but reduces magazine size."},{"name":"Steady Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6c6e1cc341487a8afd0b0c714a229255.png","desc":"This magazine is optimized for recoil control.\n  •  Greatly increases stability \n  •  Slightly decreases range\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness"}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Repulsor Brace","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/cfcbde3872d34c5258fd8227640a020e.png","desc":"Defeating a Void-debuffed target grants an overshield."},{"name":"Grave Robber","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/043d100167af67d6041719044a033221.png","desc":"Melee final blows or dealing damage with a charged melee reloads this weapon's magazine from reserves."},{"name":"Threat Detector","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9611bdbc48aff898193fd5f705c7cf30.png","desc":"Increased reload, stability, and handling when enemies are in close proximity."},{"name":"Perpetual Motion","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8b9a4582016210723532907414759e69.png","desc":"This weapon gains bonus stability, handling, and reload speed while the wielder is in motion."},{"name":"To the Pain","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/99ddf93e3cd313111f122539b17f8358.png","desc":"While this weapon is equipped, taking damage increases handling and aim assist until the weapon is stowed.\n\nTaking more damage increases the effect."},{"name":"Closing Time","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8a31da21e65dd889eb96b7e0b135bbbe.png","desc":"Improves range, accuracy, and handling as the magazine gets lower."},{"name":"Recycled Energy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c42c7a489769ae6f2d7f84be17c5732b.png","desc":"Reloading after defeating targets grants energy to your lowest charged ability."},{"name":"Steady Hands","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ed60dd27f28737cbfc77bf41c3784c01.png","desc":"Kills provide improved handling for all weapons for a short duration."},{"name":"Hip-Fire Grip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b481f0ed53a3ae0b31a370d115a06860.png","desc":"Increases accuracy, stability, and precision hit targeting when firing from the hip."},{"name":"Dynamic Sway Reduction","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/36091de4dd029fb6e6ab95dbc612ff05.png","desc":"Improves accuracy and stability while continuously holding down the trigger."},{"name":"Stats for All","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8aadd7fd25c2b1e9f3fc7f4411a97ea4.png","desc":"Hitting three separate targets increases weapon handling, stability, reload, and range for a moderate duration."},{"name":"Pugilist","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/93bb6bb34fb0616805ba2a7181ab386c.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon generate melee energy. \nDealing melee damage briefly improves this weapon's handling."},{"name":"Attrition Orbs","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c2092fae6ae58ca77a7f9b4434e688ef.png","desc":"Dealing sustained damage creates an Orb of Power."},{"name":"Offhand Strike","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/599d73ea677633784655fc4161327c14.png","desc":"Final blows grant additional weapon range, stability, and accuracy when firing from the hip for a short duration."},{"name":"Shot Swap","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ea9fceb6c5d83d5f6f0ccdbe47ce13db.png","desc":"Final blows build and store charges which allow you to swap and stow this weapon at a faster rate."},{"name":"Envious Assassin","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/bf7fccf6de8ee6d2e9e6285c004a4758.png","desc":"Defeating targets with other weapons before drawing this one transfers ammo to the magazine from reserves. This effect can overflow the magazine based on the number of targets defeated."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Destabilizing Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/30edf77113d7d1d996fcc37b7ef2050b.png","desc":"Defeating a target creates a Void burst; hitting other targets with this burst makes them volatile and grants you Volatile Rounds for a short duration."},{"name":"Swashbuckler","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/42631a4aff4432e794529a5a707eba61.png","desc":"This weapon gains increased damage from melee kills and kills with this weapon."},{"name":"Surrounded","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/979881b68ca7839267c9aef5aea2b0ce.png","desc":"This weapon gains bonus damage when three or more enemies are in close proximity."},{"name":"Rangefinder","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/74270d52bec24f1f5f4c987f5f37fce9.png","desc":"Aiming this weapon increases its effective range and zoom magnification. Increased projectile velocity while aiming Rocket Launchers, Grenade Launchers, and Bows."},{"name":"Elemental Honing","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ac0323ff44f720a8db7ae9f4dee59af4.png","desc":"Dealing unique elemental damage grants this weapon a stacking damage bonus. This bonus is increased for kinetic weapons."},{"name":"Under Pressure","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ac8ec81cd8139434a4b19e459bd9b8ff.png","desc":"Improved stability and accuracy as the magazine gets lower."},{"name":"Demoralize","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8cabe60ab649baa54f0f50a59034155d.png","desc":"Precision final blows cause nearby targets to become weakened."},{"name":"Focused Fury","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/15fb47018719c99ae37d10f794bc957e.png","desc":"Dealing a portion of the magazine as precision damage grants this weapon bonus damage. The shot count is reset whenever the weapon is reloaded or stowed."},{"name":"Turnabout","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/02786692ea8de976f059b01b4450a67e.png","desc":"Using this weapon to break the shield of a combatant or a Guardian using their Super will grant you an overshield."},{"name":"Moving Target","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40b591eae7f122fdf1cfca21fc6f6c0f.png","desc":"Increased movement speed and target acquisition when moving while aiming down sights."},{"name":"One for All","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b1bce269c3cd21393131b4f5cffae692.png","desc":"Hitting three separate targets increases damage for a moderate duration."},{"name":"Vorpal Weapon","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/bc5130b227ee577f2678ec2d2c97bf4a.png","desc":"Increased damage against bosses, vehicles, and Guardians with their Super active."},{"name":"Deconstruct","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/91de2fd6a7756ba07d301a93e1e1cf29.png","desc":"Dealing sustained damage grants bonus damage against vehicles and constructs and refills ammo from reserves. Damage with Primary ammo or against constructs provides additional progress.\n\nConstructs include barricades, turrets, Stasis crystals, and other objects created in the field."},{"name":"Collective Action","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/901c6420954a4e60fc8a521960f556a8.png","desc":"Collecting an Elemental pickup or destroying a Tangle grants this weapon a stacking period of increased damage. Throwing a Tangle provides additional time.\n\nElemental pickups include [Solar]Firesprites, [Void]Void Breaches, [Arc]Ionic Traces, [Stasis]Stasis Shards, and [Strand]Strand Tangles."},{"name":"Gutshot Straight","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/5c4c785bde7b9808d48ded283256750e.png","desc":"Aiming down sights increases body shot damage, decreases target acquisition."},{"name":"Repulsor Brace","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/cfcbde3872d34c5258fd8227640a020e.png","desc":"Defeating a Void-debuffed target grants an overshield."}]},{"label":"Origin Trait","weight":0.5,"perks":[{"name":"Classy Contender","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ea99a5550787bc2196c717e98baff076.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon grant class ability energy."},{"name":"Häkke Breach Armaments","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c154f7452e72362a34a2eac4baef5604.png","desc":"This weapon deals increased damage against vehicles and constructs.\n\nConstructs include barricades, turrets, Stasis crystals, and other objects created in the field."}]}],"modes":{"all":{"rolls":[[2,16,25,41],[8,16,25,41],[2,14,25,41],[2,15,25,41],[2,16,24,40],[4,14,24,40],[4,15,24,40],[4,16,24,40],[4,16,25,41],[4,17,24,40],[4,17,25,41],[4,17,39,54],[7,16,24,40],[7,16,25,41],[7,17,24,40],[7,17,25,41],[8,14,24,40],[8,14,25,41],[8,15,24,40],[8,15,25,41],[8,15,26,40],[8,16,24,40],[8,16,26,40],[8,17,24,40],[8,17,25,41],[8,17,39,54],[2,14,24,40],[2,14,26,41],[2,14,39,54],[2,15,24,40],[2,15,26,40],[2,15,26,41],[2,15,26,42],[2,16,26,40],[2,16,26,41],[2,16,26,42],[2,17,24,40],[2,17,25,41],[2,17,39,54],[4,13,24,40],[4,14,25,41],[4,14,39,54],[4,15,25,41],[4,17,26,41],[6,16,25,41],[7,14,24,40],[7,14,25,41],[7,15,24,40],[7,15,25,41],[7,17,26,41],[7,17,39,54],[8,13,24,40],[8,14,26,41],[8,14,39,54],[8,15,25,40],[8,15,26,41],[8,15,26,42],[8,15,32,42],[8,16,26,41],[8,16,26,42],[8,16,32,40],[8,16,39,54],[8,17,26,41],[8,17,34,40],[0,17,32,50],[11,15,26,40],[11,15,26,48],[11,15,30,40],[11,15,30,48],[11,16,26,40],[11,16,26,48],[11,16,30,40],[11,16,30,48],[2,12,24,40],[2,12,25,41],[2,12,26,41],[2,12,39,54],[2,14,34,40],[2,14,41,54],[2,14,45,54],[2,15,32,40],[2,15,32,42],[2,15,34,40],[2,15,39,54],[2,16,32,40],[2,16,32,42],[2,16,33,49],[2,16,34,40],[2,16,39,54],[2,17,26,41],[2,17,41,54],[2,17,45,54],[3,15,26,40],[3,15,26,48